# .trivyignore
# MyCodexVantaOS Trivy ignore file.
#
# Rationale: intentionally empty by default. Add CVE IDs only with
# ADR-backed risk acceptance and expiry metadata. Every entry must
# reference an Architecture Decision Record that documents:
#   - The vulnerability and its assessed risk
#   - Why the risk is acceptable (compensating controls, false positive, etc.)
#   - An expiry date after which the ignore must be re-evaluated
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNN [expiry:YYYY-MM-DD] [adr:ADR-NNN]
